WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.100
Drew! What are you doing here?

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:07.100
Hannah invited me. You look great, by the way. I
love your shirt made of pogs. Are those Pogs?

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.420
Whatever they are, I love them to death.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:11.960
Are you okay?

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.810
Why wouldn't I be okay? Because you dumped
me? Or because my dad's probably going to

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:18.560
prison till I'm 50. Or because I got buzzed
alone on Oat Milk White Russians in my

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.130
apartment earlier today and then just
wandered aimlessly around Midtown until I saw

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:26.450
a day spa advertising a "Glow-up Teeth
Whitening and Spray Tan Special" for $49.99

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.630
called The Orange Creamsicle and said to
myself, "I deserve that".

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.300
Did you get a spray tan? So natural I hadn't
noticed.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:37.690
Sorry. Sorry.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.600
Once in a while I get these shooting pains in
my two front teeth. They say it happened to one in

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:46.490
100 people who go to New York Upstairs
Whitening and Tan. Guess I'm one of the lucky ones.

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:47.960
I think I've got an Advil for you.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:51.860
No, it's all good. The receptionist gave me a couple codeine
in exchange for a kiss.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.490
Hey, I'm Ian.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.380
What's up? I'm Drew.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.610
It's my ex, Sophie.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:05.670
Don't waste this fun energy on us, Drew, go
congratulate the happy couple.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:10.520
Good point. Hey, if you need me, just follow
the light.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.880
Ooh, do I smell gefilte fish?

